<td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">97.3 (81.6)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Redundancy</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">7.7 (7.3)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top"><italic>R</italic><sub>merge</sub><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn1">&#x02020;</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">0.084 (0.301)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02329;<italic>I</italic>/&#x003c3;(<italic>I</italic>)&#x0232a;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">19.6 (7.3)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Wilson <italic>B</italic> factor (&#x000c5;<sup>2</sup>)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">24.4</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>                     <italic>R</italic>                     <sub>merge</sub> = <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="f-62-01153-efi1.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="f-62-01153-efi2.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>, where <italic>I</italic>                     <sub><italic>l</italic></sub> is the <italic>l</italic>th observation of reflection <bold>h</bold> and &#x02329;<italic>I</italic>                     <sub><bold>h</bold></sub>&#x0232a; is the weighted average intensity for all observations <italic>l</italic> of reflection <bold>h</bold>.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>